  Slug: bloodline-hag
  DisplayName: 'Bloodline: Hag'
  IconPath: icons/commodities/biological/hand-gnarled-green.webp
  Description: "A hag long ago cursed your family, or you are a descendant of a hag
    or changeling, and their magic infests your blood and soul. Tradition occult
    Bloodline Skills Deception, Occultism Sorcerous Gifts cantrip @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Daze],
    1st: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Illusory Disguise], 2nd: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Stupefy],
    3rd: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Blindness], 4th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Outcast's
    Curse], 5th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Mariner's Curse], 6th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Cursed
    Metamorphosis], 7th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Warp Mind], 8th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Quandary],
    9th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Phantasmagoria] Bloodline Spells initial:
    @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Jealous Hex], advanced: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Horrific
    Visage], greater: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.You're Mine] Blood Magic\u2014Retributive
    Spite Malice and acrimony take physical form around you. You deal 4 mental damage
    per spell rank (basic Will save) to the first creature that deals damage to you
    before the end of your next turn; if no creature damages you in that time, you
    consume that spite to gain temporary Hit Points at the beginning of your next
    turn equal to the spell's rank. These temporary Hit Points last until the beginning
    of your following turn."
